le_name": "ss3.png", "id": "2250503891965287", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035334_2250503895298620_6069743772748061378_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yepJSlp0vZwQ7kNvwGF_JCs&_nc_oc=Adn6VZjC7t4gELX1eq0vahm3SMXCbQ-ZM8c0FWjTBzrruQIQAmoL0-gHGaszuVVKB0U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afzn5Gez9r9vcLX2MNOaJ_xRphe3BcU_oK822DLNGPAI0A&oe=69B6ABDE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "1819228061920273", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982452_1819228065253606_407037206585227872_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B2Vk8c4xdJoQ7kNvwGwqOve&_nc_oc=Adlp5qDXUP4fqLyeR4wJm6sgeY_jUxxQqFncgtLLgAyL8B7T1hJTHqn1vWGSIDN3oRM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyxAY18fxPjLybN0-9GR-2Y6th-da6FdRKx-njY3aQ4Ew&oe=69B6C14A"}, "display_name": "Pinfall", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Pinfall: The Ultimate VR Bowling Experience\n\nWelcome to \"Pinfall,\" where the classic sport of bowling transcends the ordinary and enters the realm of immersive virtual reality. Prepare to embark on a cosmic adventure that transforms traditional bowling into an exhilarating and futuristic experience. Whether you're a seasoned bowler or new to the game, \"Pinfall\" offers a fresh and captivating way to enjoy this beloved sport.\nGame Overview\n\n\"Pinfall\" is a cutting-edge VR game that redefines the bowling experience by placing players in a vibrant cosmic arena. The game challenges your precision, skill, and timing as you aim to score points by knocking down pins in various celestial-themed lanes. Each game session offers a unique adventure, filled with stunning visuals and dynamic gameplay.", "short_description": "Pinfall: The Ultimate VR Bowling Experience\n\nWelcome to \"Pinfall,\" where the classic sport of bowling transcends the ordinary and enters the realm of immersive virtual reality. Prepare to embark o